<name>Pre-crash Safety</name>
<ttl id="1002M_S001G_74WTA_T00FS" variety="T00FS">
<name>Front Seat Outer Belt Assembly LH</name>
<para id="RM000000EK200CX" category="G" type-id="3001K" name-id="540K4-00" from="200708">
<name>Component Inspection</name>
<subpara id="RM000000EK200CX_01" type-id="01" category="01">
<s-1 id="RM000000EK200CX_01_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___0000CWB00000">
<ptxt>Inspect Front Seat Outer Belt Assembly LH</ptxt>
<content1 releasenbr="1">
<s2>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the connector terminals of the front seat outer belt assembly LH.</ptxt>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E106491" width="2.775699831in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.37in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>1 - 2</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>0.2 to below 100 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<atten2>
<ptxt>The front seat outer belt assembly LH has a built-in pretensioner, and incorrect inspection such as checking the wrong connector may activate the pretensioner, so be very careful to follow the correct inspection procedure.</ptxt>
</atten2>
</s2>
</content1>
</s-1>
</subpara>
</para>
